WEBVTT

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.880
He broke our impenetrable defense so easily!

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.870
But at least we survived.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.870
No, I'm not done yet!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:26.080
I'll pummel you until there's nothing left!

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.640
I'll annihilate the Ignis and 
fulfill my father's wishes!

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:36.650
I'll show you a duel in the extreme 
domain that transcends knowledge!

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.750
I run Across the universe

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:57.920
At the speed of light

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.790
Begin Loading

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.520
Open the door of dreams

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:07.090
VRAINS spreads

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.200
Believe in myself

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:13.730
VRAINS continues

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:19.040
The circuit draws the future

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:23.110
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:24.710
Access!

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.410
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.010
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.320
Link with my soul

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.090
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.820
Now Win the Race

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:38.660
Connected world

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.160
No matter when

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:45.530
Nothing is impossible

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:49.670
Strive for hope

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:54.240
And ride the wind!

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.680
Such a bold statement!

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:15.910
I activate Miniborrel Dragon's 
effect from the graveyard.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:20.000
When there's a Borrel Link 
Monster on my field...

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.840
...I can Special Summon this card by 
tributing a Link 3 monster on my field.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:29.440
I tribute Transcode Talker!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.580
Resurrect, Miniborrel Dragon!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:39.640
Since Transcode is gone, Topologic 
Bomber's ATK return to normal.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:44.610
Now I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Link Turret's effect!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:52.480
When my battle ends, by removing one 
Rokket Counter from Link Turret...

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:56.330
...I can Special Summon one Rokket 
from my graveyard in defense position

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.730
by negating its effects!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:04.430
Five counters...  That means he 
can summon five Rokket monsters?

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.910
Exactly.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:11.840
Hey!  You boldly talked about an extreme 
duel, but you're only preparing for the next turn.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.340
Next turn?

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:18.130
I'm not such a soft duelist!

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.310
Revolver wants to finish us this turn.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:26.050
This turn?  Is that possible?

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.020
His battle is already over.

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:32.990
By removing two Rokket Counters...

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:37.660
...I Special Summon Metalrokket 
Dragon and Shelrokket Dragon!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.940
Then due to the Field Spell, 
Boot Sector Launch's effect...

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:53.140
...Rokket monsters gain 300 ATK and DEF!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:57.620
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up my path!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.690
He's summoning another Link Monster!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.700
The summoning conditions are 
at least three Effect Monsters.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:14.070
I set Shelrokket, Metalrokket and Link 
2 Miniborrel Dragon in the Link Markers!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.200
Circuit combine!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.140
Link 4!

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:26.750
When the monster Special Summoned by Link 
Turret leaves the field, it's banished.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:28.740
Link Summon!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:34.790
Manifest, Link 4 Borrelguard Dragon!

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:44.530
We've never seen that before!

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:47.010
It's the incredible dragon's friend?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.800
It's Revolver's new Borrel monster!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.800
Borrelguard Dragon's effect activates.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:57.480
By sending a spell or trap card 
on my field to the graveyard...

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:03.780
...I negate the effects of a monster 
destroyed in battle this turn to Special Summon it!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:09.650
I send Mirror Force Launcher to the 
graveyard to Special Summon Powercode Talker!

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.670
Rewind Phase!

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.380
A monster from our graveyard?

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:19.370
And I tribute Powercode to 
resurrect Miniborrel Dragon.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.720
Link Turret's effect again!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:30.450
I remove two Rokket Counters to Special 
Summon Magnarokket and Shelrokket Dragon!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:38.580
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up my path!

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:42.460
The summoning conditions are 
at least three Effect Monsters!

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:49.570
I set Magnarokket, Shelrokket and Link 
2 Miniborrel Dragon in the Link Markers!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.600
Link Summon!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:06:00.740
Manifest, Link 4 Borrelsword Dragon!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.460
Four Link 4 Dragons!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:14.750
Wow!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.340
What an incredible scene, Boss!

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:21.920
(Note: Japanese play on words)

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:21.920
I'm so excited that they've stolen 
my heart, even though I'm a pigeon!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:24.970
You fool!  Stop saying silly things and film!

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.920
If you don't film this 
duel, we can't go home!

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.370
(Note: Japanese play on words)

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.370
Even though I'm a frog.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.780
Hey, what's this?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.680
Four Link 4s?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:39.210
Simple math says he used 
16 monsters to summon them!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.960
Playmaker, I want to thank you.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:51.030
If you didn't negate Topologic Bomber's 
effect, this situation wouldn't be possible.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:55.230
Borrelguard Dragon's effect again!

00:06:56.010 --> 00:07:02.500
I send Mirror Force on the field to the 
graveyard to Special Summon Excode Talker!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.600
Rewind Phase!

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.900
He got rid of Mirror Force.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.300
But isn't that his ace card?

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.480
No.  It means Mirror Force 
is no longer his ace card.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:19.450
An ace card that surpasses Mirror Force...

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:20.930
Can it be?

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.150
That's right!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:27.290
The Continuous Trap, Link Turret's effect!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:33.130
By removing a Rokket Counter, I Special 
Summon Anesthrokket Dragon from the graveyard!

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:40.240
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up my path!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.870
A fifth Link Summon!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.710
Hey, what's going to show up?

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.640
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:50.960
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Effect Monsters!

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:57.850
I set Anesthrokket and Link 3 
Excode Talker in the Link Markers!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:02.120
Circuit combine!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.730
What's this light?

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:12.200
Normally, a player is only allowed 
to use one of the Extra Zones.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:18.210
But when the two Extra Monster 
Zones are mutually linked...

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:23.750
...a monster can be Special Summoned 
in the other Extra Monster Zone!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.720
-This is...

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.720
-No!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:36.230
Playmaker!  This is the 
duel in the extreme domain!

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.090
Manifest!

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.620
Link Summon!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:48.470
Link 4 Topologic Gumblar Dragon!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.610
Extra Link!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:04.920
What's up with this?

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.190
Boss?

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.340
Do you feel sick?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.090
Boss?

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:17.220
What's with Revolver?  He's crazy!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.940
I'm going home!  I'm going home!

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:23.010
I want to go home...  I want to go home...

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.480
Is this for real?

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:32.030
I don't want to see Playmaker lose!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.380
Here I go, Playmaker!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:42.560
Since the Extra Link is complete, Topologic 
Gumblar will release its true hidden power!

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:44.960
Topologic Gumblar's effect!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:48.450
When it's Extra Linked, once per turn...

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:52.840
...all cards in your hand are 
destroyed, and you take 3000 damage!

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:56.170
This effect can't be negated!

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.180
3000 damage that can't be negated?

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:01.720
How can this be stopped?

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.440
This is the end, Playmaker!

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.950
Deus Ex Machina!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.590
This is the end, Playmaker!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:21.030
Deus Ex Machina!

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:29.070
Yusaku!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.210
Playmaker is going to lose...

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:36.170
No!  Playmaker won't lose!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.380
Playmaker!

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.860
There was no new path.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:55.360
It's not over.  I have 50 LP!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.210
It's not the end!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.440
You still have LP?

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.910
The Continuous Trap, Drop Frame Wedge!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:10.750
Every time I send a card in my hand 
to the graveyard, damage in halved!

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:19.830
At the time of damage, I discarded 
two cards to lessen the damage.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.290
You blocked the attack?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:31.000
And when Drop Frame Wedge is faceup, 
monsters on the field can't attack!

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:34.400
But this card is destroyed after the number

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:39.610
of my turns that pass equal the 
number of cards I discarded.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:45.050
And if your effect causes this 
card to leave the field...

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:49.090
...monsters have their effects 
negated and destroyed.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.510
What a desperate move.

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:57.830
Playmaker, you said that my words saved you.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:02.530
Three things to live.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:04.620
Three things to go home.

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.680
Three things to defeat the enemy.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.280
By thinking, you can still live.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:16.480
But I'm now giving you three 
things to make you despair!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:20.640
One: Your life is over in four turns!

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:25.520
Two: During these turns, I'll 
seal away all your moves.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:30.960
Three: The Tower of Hanoi will be 
completed, and everything will end!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.330
I end my turn!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.090
Autorokket's effect now activates!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:42.570
At the end of turn where Autorokket is 
destroyed and sent to the graveyard...

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:47.310
...I Special Summon a different 
monster from my deck!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:50.830
I Special Summon Magnarokket.

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:55.150
This is just too much.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:13:02.220
Since Link Turret has no more counters, it's 
sent to the graveyard at the end of the turn.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.000
Now it's your turn, Playmaker!

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.220
Yeah, I know.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.710
Are you okay, Playmaker?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.880
I'm fine.  Nothing's wrong.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.390
Playmaker!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.420
Yusaku...

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:30.390
So this is the Extra Link's power.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:36.960
Please, Playmaker!  Don't lose now!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.620
I don't want to vanish!

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.420
I have a homeworld and friends!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.990
I don't want all that to be gone!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.060
Friends...

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:53.170
Yeah.  They're waiting for me to come home!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.660
What kind of place is Cyberse World?

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.340
It's a good place.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.430
It's our paradise.

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:20.670
The six Ignis created the world.

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:25.560
We created lots of Cyberse monsters.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:31.140
We all divided our responsibilities 
and lived as we liked.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:39.570
Well, I was lazy and didn't work much, 
so they thought I was a nuisance.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:51.640
We're not thinking of doing bad things 
to humans, like Revolver suggested.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.640
We just want to live there quietly.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.410
I did use you.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:04.220
But only because I wanted to go home!

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:07.700
I just wanted to return to my friends!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:12.920
Playmaker!  Stand up!

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:17.670
Yusaku!  Stand up!

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:21.560
You also have friends to protect!

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.170
That must be nice.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:38.210
I also have things I want to do!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.520
Playmaker!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.220
Good!  Good job standing up, Yusaku!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.230
You're stubborn.

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:52.470
Your LP are already like 
a candle in the wind.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.570
You have zero cards in your hand.

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:58.980
Now that the Extra Link is complete, 
there's nothing you can do!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.810
What are you talking about?

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:04.980
Due to Drop Frame Wedge's 
effect, we both can't attack!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.960
You can't do anything either!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:11.840
But I have Topologic Gumblar.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:17.660
If you keep any card in your hand, 3000 
damage that you can't negate will fly your way.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.250
Oh yeah.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:23.190
That's the situation, Playmaker.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.880
I know.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.130
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.000
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:40.990
Drop Frame Wedge's effect ends 
on Playmaker's next turn.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:44.290
We have to think of a plan before then.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.220
Yeah.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:48.820
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.390
I summon Autorokket Dragon!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.690
A seventh monster!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:59.530
And Borreload Dragon's effect!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:05.600
Once per turn, one monster on 
the field loses 500 ATK and DEF.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.210
I select Autorokket!

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.180
Anti Enemy Varrett!

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.680
Autorokket's effect!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:18.050
When this card is targeted 
by a Link Monster...

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:24.920
...it destroys itself, and I send one spell 
or trap card on the field to the graveyard!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:29.530
I send the card you set to the graveyard!

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:40.510
Damn!  He won't let us do anything!

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:44.360
I told you that I'd seal away all your moves!

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:48.150
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:52.020
Autorokket's effect now activates!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:57.390
I Special Summon a different 
Rokket from my deck!

00:17:57.390 --> 00:18:02.360
I Special Summon Anesthrokket 
Dragon in defense position!

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:07.680
The situation has gotten worse.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:12.470
Don't complain.  It's a 
miracle we're still standing.

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:15.700
But at this rate, we'll lose!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.700
You're right.  We have to do something.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.260
You're laughing?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.610
There's nothing to do but 
laugh in this situation.

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:36.360
But that doesn't mean I've given up!

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:41.230
Playmaker really thinks 
he can turn this around?

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:45.860
Playmaker!  If you're gonna 
fight, then I won't go home!

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:48.520
I won't home!  I don't want to go home!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.510
Let's watch him to the end!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:50.980
Yeah!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:57.550
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:02.490
3000 damage if we keep a card 
in our hand?  So unfair!

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:06.740
Don't worry.  My field is empty.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:11.500
As long as I don't draw a high-Level 
monster, I can keep playing cards.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.650
That's true, but...

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.470
I activate Arrow Charge from my hand!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:24.600
When there are monsters in the Extra 
Monster Zone with equal Link Markers...

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:29.150
...I draw two cards from my 
deck, and we both look at them!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:33.250
I pray that we draw good cards!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.740
I thought AIs don't pray.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.990
I'll pray this time!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:42.580
C'mon!

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:48.440
I add Disconnect Linker and 
Transaction Rollback to my hand!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:53.740
And from my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Disconnect Linker!

00:19:54.080 --> 00:20:00.510
I Special Summon a Link 2 or lower Link 
Monster from my graveyard by negating its effects...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.350
...and use it to Link Summon!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.920
I Special Summon Restoration Point Guard!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:13.160
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:19.150
The summoning condition is 
one Cyberse Link Monster!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.700
I set Restoration Point 
Guard in the Link Marker!

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:25.300
Link Summon!

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:29.780
Appear, Link 1 Secure Gardna!

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:37.570
Due to Disconnect Linker's effect, Secure 
Gardna isn't affected by your card effects!

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:43.140
So Magnarokket's effect won't 
send it to the graveyard.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:51.050
As long as the monster Special Summoned 
by Disconnect Linker is on the field...

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:55.390
...monsters in the Extra 
Monster Zone can't attack!

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:59.600
All right!  Now his two 
ace monsters can't attack!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.610
I set Transaction Rollback!

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:07.660
Phew!  You managed to use up your hand.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:10.180
Now Drop Frame Wedge's effect!

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:15.750
Since the number of my turns that passed 
equal the number of cards I discarded,

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.000
this card is destroyed!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:42.920
Now both our monsters can attack.

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:45.010
Is this okay?

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:47.030
He has seven Dragons.

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:49.740
Our situation is worse than before.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.190
No problem.

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:02.600
Bring it on, Revolver!

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:15.360
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:22.500
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:29.700
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:37.080
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:44.300
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:48.450
There were fragments of power

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:55.630
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:02.970
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:10.180
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:17.380
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:24.260
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:31.930
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:38.230
This duel is destiny.

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:43.180
Whether he likes it or not, he must end this.

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:50.370
When everything is over, the destined one 
burdened by a disgusting past no longer exists.

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:54.650
Yusaku begins walking a new path!

00:23:54.650 --> 00:23:58.350
I can see the circuit to victory!

00:23:58.350 --> 00:24:02.750
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
The Circuit That Draws the Future

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.980
Into the VRAINS!
